  "note": "Parameters that already live in the residential catalog, the stacking catalog or the client rulesets, registered by reference (path into their store; never copied). '{t}' expands over 'for'. range_rel = range as multiples of the baseline value. The new design parameters are discovered from the design rulesets (parameter objects).",
